      "position": {
        "x": -616,
        "y": 0
      },
      "params": {
        "text": "Filter the sound\n\n`sound/filter` is a biquad (lowpass / highpass / bandpass). Wire any audio source into it, then on into `sound/output`.\n\nMouseX → filter cutoff frequency. A saw wave through a sweeping filter — the classic synth sound.",
        "width": 420,
        "height": 220
      },
      "portValues": {
        "text": "Filter the sound\n\n`sound/filter` is a biquad (lowpass / highpass / bandpass). Wire any audio source into it, then on into `sound/output`.\n\nMouseX → filter cutoff frequency. A saw wave through a sweeping filter — the classic synth sound.",
